                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63831481-891b-3b6f-9f6d-15948437cccf",
                                        "entry_id": "33b3b955-0a10-33df-904e-8347da9b189e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A statement of the meaning of a word, word group, sign, or symbol; especially, a dictionary definition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfefc81f-441f-4718-b035-ee9324f07513",
                                                "sense_id": "63831481-891b-3b6f-9f6d-15948437cccf",
                                                "text": "Your definition of \"elephant\" needs to be more precise than \"a big animal with large ears\"."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32af3f83-2bd5-4654-a44b-734f08140159",
                                                "sense_id": "63831481-891b-3b6f-9f6d-15948437cccf",
                                                "text": "DEFINITIONS mean nothing unless the concept in the mind of the men who makes the definition is the same as that in the mind of the man who hears it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08a5f492-086f-4480-aa04-f959d052e1d0",
                                                "sense_id": "63831481-891b-3b6f-9f6d-15948437cccf",
                                                "text": "Phrases such as “woman of the moment” were added to equal the old saying of the “man of the moment.” And one of the definitions of “woman” now refers to a “person’s wife, girlfriend, or female lover,” as opposed to being tied to only a man."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e869f440-852b-3a97-94d0-950e9ce92b6b",
                                        "entry_id": "33b3b955-0a10-33df-904e-8347da9b189e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A clear instance conforming to the dictionary or textbook definition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23f15a47-58ed-4f2b-8396-78ec7a61554b",
                                                "sense_id": "e869f440-852b-3a97-94d0-950e9ce92b6b",
                                                "text": "Baroque is a good game, but only for a very narrow subset of the gaming audience. It is the very definition of a niche title."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef0056e7-00e6-46f3-8583-ebdf10f30807",
                                                "sense_id": "e869f440-852b-3a97-94d0-950e9ce92b6b",
                                                "text": "Comedy Bang! Bang! It’s silly, it spoofy – it’s the very definition of a hidden gem"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ea3b55e-a064-48b7-8a53-dd199c107a8c",
                                                "sense_id": "e869f440-852b-3a97-94d0-950e9ce92b6b",
                                                "text": "That Trump just came out and asked for Zelensky to investigate the Bidens – after reminding him several times of how much the US did for Ukraine!!!! – is something very close to the textbook definition of a quid pro quo."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cedadda3-4569-376b-9254-3a02d009fa47",
                                        "entry_id": "33b3b955-0a10-33df-904e-8347da9b189e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A statement expressing the essential nature of something; formulation"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
